0,north,"I will start by exploring the room I'm currently in and then move to the adjacent areas. Given the walls near me, my first priority is to move north or northeast to get a better understanding of the level layout. I will use the 'search' action to look for hidden doors and passages. Once I have a better understanding of the level, I will prioritize moving towards the stairs down. I will use my sword and shield to defend myself if I encounter any enemies. If I find a door, I will try to 'open' it. If a door is locked or I encounter an enemy, I will use the 'kick' action. My goal is to efficiently explore the level while being cautious of potential threats.","message:


